  "prefLabel": "Psyc 304.03 Application Process",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Psyc 304.03 Application Process.\n\n(a) Persons wishing to obtain a telepass license as a psychologist in New Hampshire shall apply to the OPLC by submitting the following:\n\n(1) An application for telepass license, which contains the information specified in Psyc 304.04;\n\n(2) Supporting documents required of the applicant, as specified in Psyc 304.05; and\n\n(3) Pay any fees in accordance with Plc 1002.43 and Plc 1001.08.\n\n(b) The application and supporting documents shall be processed in accordance with Plc 304.06 through Plc 304.14.\n\nSource. #13862, eff 4-2-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/psyc100-500.html"
